    "aresKeywords": "pyramidal frustum, surface area, trapezoidal face, square base, slant height, net, solid geometry, derivation, cardboard model, Kenya Grade 10, Essential Mathematics, KICD, CBE, measurements and geometry, trophy stand, Nakuru, Kirinyaga Road, planter box, frustum formula, lateral face area"
