      "safetyNotes": "No chemicals or sharp tools are used in this lesson. If physical bucket models or nets are handled, learners should take care with any metal-edged cut-outs. Ensure group presentations are conducted in a respectful, orderly manner. Online safety guidelines apply if learners use digital devices to search for real-life dimensions of Kenyan structures."
